        {
          "id": "c",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Neither changes: strings 3-4-5 hold the identical charts, five frets lower."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The chords change, because a progression played on a lower set is a progression in a lower key."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "answerId": "a",
      "explanation": [
        {
          "text": "Read it off the table: the charts share nothing, but "
        },
        {
          "text": "C",
          "marks": ["code"]
